The ordering
$\ssr[(1)] \le \ssr[(2)], \ssr[(2)] \le \ssr[(3)], \ldots, \ssr[(\nstrat-1)] \le \ssr[(\nstrat)]$ is
of the form $\AAA\svsr\le\bbb$, 
we are performing inference on $\trbasev[(\nstrat)]{\pvsnr}$.






%Observe: when \RMAT is correlation of returns, then
	%\vspace{-2mm}
%\begin{equation}
