%\emph{Main idea}:
%``invert'' \chol{\pvsig} transform to get a normal $z$ linear in \yvec,
	%such that the conditional part restricts $z$ to a line segment, $\ccinterval{\Vmin}{\Vmax}.$\\
%Then get a p-value via
